  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/IMG_8266.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(40 fotos) Aquest divendres, l&#39;alumnat de cinqu&egrave; curs del col&middot;legi Pius XII d&#39;Onda ha jugat partides de raspall al carrer del Pare Ten, dins del projecte mensual dedicat a la pilota valenciana, de manera que totes les assignatures giren al voltant d&#39;aquest tema.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8260.jpg\" alt=\"img_8260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8261.jpg\" alt=\"img_8261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8263.jpg\" alt=\"img_8263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8264.jpg\" alt=\"img_8264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8265.jpg\" alt=\"img_8265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8266.jpg\" alt=\"img_8266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8267.jpg\" alt=\"img_8267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8268.jpg\" alt=\"img_8268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilotapiusxiicarrerdelpareten/img_8269.jpg\" alt=\"img_8269\" style=\"max